      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If you don't want share freely, you should watermark your pictures with your own logo.\n\nThat way it's less useful for others because the watermark.\nVRChat images are not bound to users, others can use it. It's public program.\n\nPhotos specially made from some worlds are also for fair use. If you dont want share too much, make your unique avatar for yourself, and use it in screenshots. Unique avatars are useless for others, because it's only from you, so you can claim it's yourself.\nThis is what most streamers will do it with own unique avatars. Don't use public avatars too much, they will not help you.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
